      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow6:113",
        "answer": "Takes menu f1_arg0, controller f1_arg1 and eight layout bounds f1_arg2..f1_arg9; calls LUI.UIElement.new and sets the literal class/id/sound. Creates a feather-edged tinted backer followed by a TeamNumber text label initialized to numeric 1. It does not read an actual team-number model here. The exact placeholder, layout, font and alignment remain literal source values. Exact child order: Backer, TeamNumber. All layout/property/asset values and each callback body are retained in the ordered trace. Calls the optional same-file-or-unresolved PostLoadFunc at its exact source position, then returns self; a same name in another file supplies no binding. Base/child lifetime, model/event/animation delivery and native asset behavior remain external unless a reused exact provider contract explicitly supplies the bounded fact.",
